OL,4,CFuel price hike will make life 'almost 
OL,5,Cimpossible'                            
OL,6,GA 26% increase in energy bills in      
OL,7,GJanuary will make life "almost         
OL,8,Gimpossible" for millions of people, a  
OL,9,Gcharity boss has warned.               
OL,11,FMatt Cole, the CEO of the Fuel Bank    
OL,12,FFoundation which helps people living   
OL,13,Fin fuel crisis, said the rise had been 
OL,14,Fexpected but would be difficult for    
OL,15,Fpeople to absorb.                      
OL,17,FWith fuel prices already high, he      
OL,18,Fsaid: "It's going to make what's a     
OL,19,Ftough life for so many people almost   
OL,20,Fimpossible."                           
